  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/03/LligaImpro5març.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 218px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(234 fotos) La tarde de este domingo a las 19 horas, en La Cassola, se juega el quinto partido de la V Liga de Improvisaci&oacute;n Teatral de Onda entre los equipos Zona Azul y Armadillos, cuya tem&aacute;tica estar&aacute; dedicada especialmente a la mujer.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/03/P1490964.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">La semana pasada Som=Rojados venci&oacute; 7-5 a The Br&oacute;colis Power, que va encabezando la clasificaci&oacute;n con 4 puntos.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/4artpatitlligaimpro17/lligaimpro5marc.jpg\" alt=\"lligaimpro5marc\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/4artpatitlligaimpro17/p1490654.jpg\" alt=\"p1490654\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/4artpatitlligaimpro17/p1490655.jpg\" alt=\"p1490655\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/4artpatitlligaimpro17/p1490656.jpg\" alt=\"p1490656\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/4artpatitlligaimpro17/p1490657.jpg\" alt=\"p1490657\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/4artpatitlligaimpro17/p1490658.jpg\" alt=\"p1490658\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d